Package: com.chasedavis.lowerinstall
Name: LowerInstall
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 15.0)
Version: 1.4.1-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Dual-dylib package (AppSync-style): LowerInstall → appstored/AppStore, LowerInstallInstalld → installd only. Check /var/mobile/Library/Logs/LowerInstall/ for installd.loaded after reboot.
Maintainer: Chase Davis
Author: julioverne (original), Chase Davis (iOS 17/RootHide port)
